{"unit_id":"EasyTZ__dsh-git#card-zh","repo":"EasyTZ/dsh-git","commit":"e8110533399c661bc38a081314fb49d230fefce9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-git 是 DeepSeek Harness 网页客户端的可视化 Git 面板，在侧边栏添加入口，并通过本地 webServer 路由读取和操作当前工作区仓库。面板可查看工作区改动、逐文件暂存与取消暂存、填写提交信息并提交、推送本地提交、切换分支、浏览提交历史和文件增删统计，也可撤销最近一次提交。适合希望在 DSH 会话中完成常用 Git 操作的开发者。需要本机安装 Git 并配置仓库；推送需已有远端和 Git 凭据，不需要额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1542-1567","lib/index.js:238-303","lib/index.js:414-461","lib/index.js:467-580"]}
{"unit_id":"EasyTZ__dsh-git#card-en","repo":"EasyTZ/dsh-git","commit":"e8110533399c661bc38a081314fb49d230fefce9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-git adds a visual Git panel to the DSH web sidebar. It shows repository changes, stages files, commits, pushes, switches branches, and displays commit history and file change counts. The latest commit can be undone. Git and repository credentials for pushing are needed; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1542-1567","lib/index.js:238-303","lib/index.js:414-461","lib/index.js:467-580"]}
